        "meaning": "Explain the particular support and the learner's action with it.",
        "example": "If an explanation-language need is documented, I will offer a claim-evidence-explanation strip and a short oral rehearsal with a partner. FS1 will state a claim, identify a paragraph, and explain the connection in their own words before writing. The listener will paraphrase and ask a clarifying question. I will supply language choices such as develops or because without supplying the text interpretation.",
