        "example": "I will cite [actual dated task] and [accurate response] showing the point where FS1's explanation needed support. For example, evidence selection accompanied by an unclear relationship would justify an explanation scaffold; inaccurate evidence selection would require a different response. I will compare the learner's response before and after the relevant support and report any remaining uncertainty.",
