        "example": "I will examine whether FS2 distinguishes a topic from a central idea, identifies two substantive ideas, selects relevant details, and explains how later paragraphs develop them. A learner who reads the passage fluently but writes only equipment as the main idea needs a different support from a learner who cannot access the words. These are conditional distinctions to test, not a profile assigned to FS2.",
