        "example": "If actual work shows that FS2 lists details without forming a central-idea statement, I will target the relationship between a group of details and a broader claim. If FS2 names two ideas but does not trace development, I will target what a later paragraph adds. I will choose the need shown by the response rather than assume that all struggling readers share the same difficulty.",
