        "example": "I will use an unfilled two-idea map with movable paragraph-reference cards. FS2 will place a detail under a tentative idea, read or hear the relevant passage, and explain why the placement fits. A card may support both ideas if the student can justify that relationship. I will model the procedure with a separate example, then ask FS2 to complete and revise the map for this passage.",
