        "example": "I will use the credited 1836 transcription, short modern context, source ledger, claim-comparison cards, collaboration protocol and independent museum-label task. The original text and teacher paraphrase are visibly separated. The teacher key identifies 34 hours elapsed, unknown total breaks and the source’s limited reach; students do not receive that key as their response.",
