        "example": "The conditional plan would be appropriate only if actual evidence establishes a verified difficulty expressing or interpreting the initial/final/change relation despite whatever mathematical strengths the actual work establishes. I would identify the source, task, and observed pattern rather than infer it from an EL/disability/behavior label.",
