        "meaning": "State the targeted content learning for the selected follow-up.",
        "example": "Re-teach branch: explain how an earlier and later paragraph develop the relationship between predictable planning and flexible access in Text C. Extension branch: explain how the two values interact and evaluate a qualified interpretation using details from more than one paragraph. If the actual gap is author attribution instead, use the viewpoint-focused alternative and state that goal explicitly.",
