        "example": "Re-teach branch: use a concise sentence linking a text detail to an idea, with clear referents and an appropriate relationship word. Extension branch: paraphrase a competing interpretation accurately and use qualification or contrast to explain a justified revision. Match the actual FS's selected ELD expectations and document supports; these are not fixed proficiency assignments.",
