        "example": "After Lesson 3, each learner independently replaces an overclaimed museum statement with a dated, sourced argument using the enforcement table and statute, with modern context identified separately. Criteria address accurate source use, inference, limits/counterclaim and ELD attribution/connection. I will not infer individual writing ability from a polished pair draft.",
        "why": "The response connects a defined learning demand to a visible task and interpretable evidence.",
